## 2. Synthesis with DNK OS Cognitive Architecture

| Dimension | `task-observer` Approach | DNK OS Unified Hybrid Implementation |
|---|---|---|
| **Storage** | Hundreds of `NNNN-slug.md` disk files. | Multi-tier: SCONES Memory (`ws-alpha-001`), `MEMORY.md`, and Obsidian Vault (`./docs/notes/`). |
| **Recovery** | Manual weekly review or prompt ping. | Instant Error Distillation (`dnk_query_error_solutions` + `dnk_record_error_solution`). |
| **Verification** | Syntax check on skill frontmatter. | Deterministic Quality Gate (`scripts/verify_all.sh` 100% Green) + `validate_skill_bundle.py`. |
| **Orchestration** | Single interactive assistant. | 14-Agent Swarm with Step 0 Autonomous Triage (`dnk_triage_task`). |

